---
import Settings from '../layouts/Settings.astro';
const {productId=null}=Astro.props;
---
<Settings title={productId?'HobbyNest product details':'HobbyNest store administration'} section="hobbynest">
<div id="nest-admin" data-product-id={productId}><header class="nest-heading"><div><h2 id="nest-page-title">{productId?'Product details':'HobbyNest'}</h2><p>{productId?<a href="/studio/hobbynest">← All products</a>:'Products, stock & shipping · AUD'}</p></div><div class="nest-header-links"><a href="/hobbynest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop preview ↗</a><details class="nest-admin-options"><summary>Store options</summary><div class="nest-tools"><button type="button" id="nest-reload">Reload latest</button><button type="button" id="nest-export" disabled>Export catalogue backup</button></div></details></div></header>
<p id="nest-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading store…</p>
<div class="nest-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Store administration">{(productId?[['products','Details'],['images','Images'],['costing','Costs & pricing'],['inventory','Stock & colours']]:[['products','Products'],['import','Import'],['store','Store controls'],['inventory','Stock'],['collections','Collections'],['discounts','Discounts'],['shipping','Shipping'],['estimate','Test estimate']]).map(([id,label],i)=><button type="button" role="tab" id={'nest-tab-'+id} aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} aria-controls={'nest-panel-'+id} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}>{label}</button>)}</div>
<div id="nest-panels" inert>
<section id="nest-panel-products" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-products">{productId?<><form id="nest-product" class="nest-form"></form><div id="nest-publication" class="nest-actions"></div></>:<><div class="nest-catalogue-tools"><label>Find products<input type="search" id="nest-search" placeholder="Name, SKU or collection"/></label><label>Status<select id="nest-filter"><option value="all">All products</option><option value="published">Published</option><option value="draft">Draft / unpublished</option></select></label><a class="nest-add" href="/studio/hobbynest/products/new">+ Add product</a></div><p id="nest-product-count" class="nest-count"></p><div id="nest-products" class="nest-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Products summary" tabindex="0"></div></>}</section>
{productId&&<section id="nest-panel-images" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-images" hidden><div class="nest-section-head"><h3>Product images</h3><button type="button" id="nest-publish-images">Publish saved draft</button></div><p class="nest-image-help">The first image is the cover. Changes stay private until you publish the saved draft. Up to 12 photos; JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 20 MiB each before optimisation.</p><div id="nest-images" class="nest-images"></div><form id="nest-image-upload" class="nest-form"><label>Choose image<input name="image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required/></label><label>Image description (alt text)<input name="alt" type="text" maxlength="240" required/></label><button type="submit">Upload image to draft</button></form></section>}

{productId&&<section id="nest-panel-costing" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-costing" hidden><h3>Unit cost & suggested price</h3><p>Estimate materials, printing, labour and overheads. This is a planning estimate, not an accounting COGS record. Filament grams include supports and are separate from packed shipping weight. Payment fees are entered by you; no Square tariff is assumed.</p><div class="nest-cost-layout"><form id="nest-costing" class="nest-form"></form><aside><div id="nest-costing-result" class="nest-table-scroll nest-list" aria-live="polite"></div></aside></div></section>}
{!productId&&<section id="nest-panel-import" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-import" hidden><div id="nest-import"><h3>Import spreadsheet products</h3><p>Use the template or map your own columns. Required: SKU, product name, physical/digital type and AUD price. Products start as drafts; review the preview before saving.</p><div class="nest-actions"><button type="button" id="nest-import-template">Download Excel template</button></div><label class="nest-import-file">Spreadsheet (.xlsx or CSV, up to 5 MiB)<input id="nest-import-file" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.csv"/></label><label id="nest-import-sheet-label" hidden>Worksheet<select id="nest-import-sheet"></select></label><p id="nest-import-status" role="status">Choose a spreadsheet to begin.</p><div id="nest-import-mapping"></div><div id="nest-import-options" hidden><label class="nest-inline-check"><input type="checkbox" id="nest-import-update"/>Update matching SKU drafts (published listings and existing stock stay unchanged)</label><label class="nest-inline-check"><input type="checkbox" id="nest-import-stock"/>Include opening stock for new products only</label><button type="button" id="nest-import-preview">Preview import</button></div><div id="nest-import-preview-area" class="nest-table-scroll"></div><button type="button" id="nest-import-apply" hidden disabled>Import reviewed drafts</button><details class="nest-disclosure"><summary>Format, units & import rules</summary><div id="nest-import-guide" class="nest-table-scroll"></div><p>One row per product/colour. Repeat the SKU and product details for each new physical colour. Existing colours, stock, costing and photos are kept on updates. Create named collections before importing; separate their names with |. Images are added on the product page. Save formulas as pasted values. Format SKU cells as text to preserve leading zeros. Up to 300 rows / 150 products; older .xls files must be saved as .xlsx. CSV uses commas and quoted text.</p></details></div></section>}
<section id="nest-panel-store" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-store" hidden><div class="nest-section-head"><h3>Open or pause each shop</h3><a class="nest-add" href="/hobbynest?test=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open test shop ↗</a></div><p>Control printed products and downloadable STL designs separately. Paused products remain visible with your message. These controls are ready to test; real orders and payments remain disabled until checkout is connected.</p><form id="nest-store-controls" class="nest-form"></form><p>In the test shop, add items to the owner-only basket and calculate discounts, stock, dispatch and postage. No order is created and no stock is reserved or deducted.</p></section>
<section id="nest-panel-inventory" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-inventory" hidden><h3>Stock & colours</h3><div id="nest-stock-summary" class="nest-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Stock summary" tabindex="0"></div><details class="nest-disclosure"><summary>Receive or adjust stock</summary><p>Count finished, sellable pieces only. Changes update published availability immediately.</p><form id="nest-stock" class="nest-form"></form></details><h3>Colours & filament</h3><p>Finished inventory is counted per colour. Filament availability enables printing when that colour has no finished stock. Hide a colour to stop offering it without losing its stock history.</p><form id="nest-colour-product" class="nest-form"></form><div id="nest-colours" class="nest-list"></div><button type="button" id="nest-new-colour">+ Add colour</button><form id="nest-colour" class="nest-form"></form><details class="nest-disclosure"><summary>Recent stock movements</summary><p>Last 500 changes across the store. Export regularly to retain your history.</p><div id="nest-movements" class="nest-list"></div></details></section>
<section id="nest-panel-collections" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-collections" hidden><h3>Collections & catalogues</h3><p>Group products into collections. Hiding a collection hides its filter; unpublish individual products to remove them from the shop.</p><div id="nest-collections" class="nest-list"></div><button type="button" id="nest-new-collection">+ Add collection</button><form id="nest-collection" class="nest-form"></form></section>
<section id="nest-panel-discounts" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-discounts" hidden><h3>Discounts & codes</h3><p>Leave the code blank for an automatic offer. One best eligible discount applies; offers do not stack. Usage limits and redemptions need the future checkout ledger.</p><div id="nest-discounts" class="nest-list"></div><button type="button" id="nest-new-discount">+ Add discount</button><form id="nest-discount" class="nest-form"></form></section>
<section id="nest-panel-shipping" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-shipping" hidden><h3>Australian shipping</h3><details class="nest-disclosure"><summary>Australia Post live estimates & monthly check</summary><p id="nest-carrier-status" role="status"></p><p>Uses current Postage Assessment Calculator service prices, subject to real account/API verification. Each physical unit is treated as a separate measured parcel. Combining products, contract pricing, extras and labels are not configured.</p><form id="nest-carrier" class="nest-form"></form><button type="button" id="nest-carrier-check">Check connection & sample rates now</button><div id="nest-carrier-review"></div><p>Set the dispatch postcode below and add <code>AUSPOST_PAC_API_KEY</code> as a server-only Netlify secret. Do not paste keys here. This does not activate orders or payments.</p></details><p>These are rates you set, not Australia Post quotes. An empty state selection covers all Australia. No matching rate means no estimate is available. International shipping is not configured.</p><form id="nest-shipping" class="nest-form"></form><div id="nest-rates" class="nest-list"></div><button type="button" id="nest-new-rate">+ Add shipping rate</button><form id="nest-rate" class="nest-form"></form><p>Manual rates apply when Australia Post live estimates are disabled. Live mode requires API access, a dispatch postcode, destination postcode and all packed dimensions. Failed live quotes do not fall back to free postage or a manual rate.</p></section>
<section id="nest-panel-estimate" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="nest-tab-estimate" hidden><h3>Test a customer estimate</h3><p>Uses published prices and current stock. This does not place an order, reserve stock or take a payment. Mixed physical orders ship together; the longest dispatch estimate applies. Shipping thresholds use the discounted merchandise total.</p><form id="nest-estimate" class="nest-form"></form><div id="nest-estimate-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
</div></div>
</Settings>
<script>import '../scripts/hobbynest-admin.mjs';</script>
<style>
#nest-admin{font-size:14px}.nest-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:start}.nest-heading p{margin:0}.nest-heading h2{margin-bottom:4px!important}.nest-notice{margin:8px 0!important}.nest-tools{gap:6px!important}.nest-tabs{margin:8px 0 12px!important}#nest-status{min-height:1.5em!important;margin:8px 0!important;font-size:12px!important}.nest-heading>a{font-size:12px;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.nest-notice{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px}.nest-tools,.nest-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}#nest-admin :global(button){font:inherit;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px}#nest-admin :global(button:disabled){opacity:.6;cursor:default}.nest-tabs{display:flex;overflow:auto;gap:6px;margin:16px 0}.nest-tabs button{flex-shrink:0}.nest-tabs [aria-selected=true]{background:var(--accent)!important;color:var(--surface)!important}.nest-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(145px,.6fr) minmax(0,1.5fr);gap:20px}.nest-split>*{min-width:0}.nest-list{margin:10px 0 18px}.nest-list :global(.nest-row){display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:9px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.nest-list :global(.nest-row>span){min-width:0}.nest-list :global(small){display:block;font-size:12px;opacity:.8}.nest-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:14px 0 20px}.nest-form :global(label){display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0;font-size:12px}.nest-form :global(input),.nest-form :global(select),.nest-form :global(textarea){width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;font-size:16px;min-height:44px}.nest-form :global(textarea){border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);resize:vertical}.nest-form :global(summary){cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;padding:10px 0}.nest-form :global(.nest-pack-grid){display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.nest-form :global(.nest-wide){grid-column:1/-1}.nest-form :global(button){justify-self:start}.nest-form :global(select[multiple]){min-height:100px}.nest-form :global(.nest-help){margin:0;font-size:12px;opacity:.8;grid-column:1/-1}#nest-status{min-height:2.5em;opacity:1}#nest-estimate-result :global(p){opacity:1}@media(max-width:620px){.nest-split{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.nest-form{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.nest-heading{flex-wrap:wrap}.nest-list :global(.nest-row){flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(forced-colors:active){.nest-tabs [aria-selected=true]{outline:2px solid Highlight}}

.nest-header-links{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:12px}.nest-header-links>a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.nest-admin-options{position:relative}.nest-admin-options summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:list-item;padding:10px 0;box-sizing:border-box}.nest-admin-options .nest-tools{position:absolute;right:0;top:100%;width:210px;padding:10px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;z-index:3;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #0002}.nest-admin-options button{width:100%}.nest-form :global(.nest-store-toggle){display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;min-height:44px}.nest-form :global(.nest-store-toggle input){width:20px!important;height:20px;min-height:20px;accent-color:var(--accent)}.nest-cost-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(240px,.8fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}.nest-cost-layout>aside{position:sticky;top:16px;min-width:0}.nest-cost-layout :global(details summary){cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;padding:10px 0}.nest-cost-layout :global(.nest-row){font-size:13px}.nest-cost-layout :global(.nest-row:nth-child(2)){font-weight:600}@media(max-width:1000px){.nest-cost-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.nest-cost-layout>aside{position:static;order:-1}}.nest-import-file{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:14px 0;font-size:13px}.nest-import-file input{max-width:100%;font-size:16px;min-height:44px}.nest-inline-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;min-height:44px}#nest-import-mapping :global(.nest-map-grid){display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}#nest-import-mapping :global(label){display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px;min-width:0}#nest-import-mapping :global(select){width:100%;min-height:44px;font-size:16px}.nest-catalogue-tools{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.nest-catalogue-tools label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0;flex:1;font-size:12px}.nest-catalogue-tools input,.nest-catalogue-tools select{width:100%;min-height:44px;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box}.nest-add{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}#nest-products :global(td){padding:6px 8px}#nest-products :global(td a){min-height:28px}.nest-count{font-size:12px!important;margin:8px 0!important}.nest-table-scroll{overflow:auto;max-width:100%}.nest-table-scroll :global(table){width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;text-align:left}.nest-table-scroll :global(th){font-size:11px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.nest-table-scroll :global(td){padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:middle;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.nest-table-scroll :global(td a){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-weight:500}.nest-table-scroll :global(small){display:block;font-size:11px;opacity:.8}.nest-table-scroll :global(.nest-thumb){width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:5px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 8%,transparent);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:10px}.nest-table-scroll :global(tr[data-href]){cursor:pointer}.nest-table-scroll :global(tr[data-href]:hover),.nest-table-scroll :global(tr[data-href]:focus-within){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,transparent)}.nest-table-scroll :global(.nest-table-name){min-width:140px;max-width:250px}.nest-table-scroll :global(.nest-badge){display:inline-block;padding:3px 6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.nest-disclosure{border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:12px 0;padding-top:4px}.nest-disclosure>summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;padding:10px 0;box-sizing:border-box}.nest-images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.nest-images :global(article){min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:10px}.nest-images :global(img){width:100%;height:140px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,transparent)}.nest-images :global(label){font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.nest-images :global(input){width:100%;min-height:44px;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box}.nest-images :global(form){display:grid;gap:6px}.nest-images :global(.nest-actions){display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.nest-section-head{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.nest-section-head h3{margin:0}.nest-image-help{font-size:12px!important}#nest-admin[data-product-id] .nest-form{max-width:850px}.nest-table-scroll :global(.nest-empty){padding:16px 8px;font-size:13px}.nest-images :global(small){display:block;margin:6px 0;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:900px){.nest-images{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:620px){#nest-import-mapping :global(.nest-map-grid){grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.nest-catalogue-tools label:first-child{flex-basis:100%}.nest-images{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#nest-products :global(table),#nest-products :global(tbody){display:block}#nest-products :global(thead){position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}#nest-products :global(tr){display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:4px 10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#nest-products :global(td){border:0;padding:0;min-width:0}#nest-products :global(.nest-table-name){max-width:none;min-width:0;grid-column:2/4}#nest-products :global(.nest-col-image){grid-row:1/4}#nest-products :global(.nest-col-price){grid-row:2;grid-column:2}#nest-products :global(.nest-col-status){grid-row:2;grid-column:3}#nest-products :global(.nest-col-stock),#nest-products :global(.nest-col-dispatch){grid-column:2/4}#nest-products :global(.nest-table-name a){min-height:44px}.nest-section-head{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
